---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "15px"
    primaryColor: "#e6effc"
    primaryBorderColor: "#416dad"
    primaryTextColor: "#203a63"
    lineColor: "#475569"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Requested: Select chainpoint
    Requested --> Active: Acquire view
    Requested --> Unavailable: View absent
    Active --> Active: Read or paginate
    Active --> Expired: Lease expires
    Active --> Closed: Release session
    Active --> BranchDecision: Block rolled back
    state "Branch policy unresolved" as BranchDecision
    Unavailable --> [*]: Explicit refusal
    Expired --> [*]: Further reads refused
    Closed --> [*]: Release view
    note right of BranchDecision
      No outcome chosen yet
    end note
